WEBVTT

00:05:29.746 --> 00:05:32.496
but it does more than that. It
affects our daily lives.

00:05:32.496 --> 00:05:33.788
It affects our physical health.

00:05:33.788 --> 00:05:38.538
It seems it affects our ability to
imagine a possibility of living

00:05:38.538 --> 00:05:40.871
a more productive and more hopeful
life for our families.

00:05:41.329 --> 00:05:42.871
And those links are broken.

00:05:42.996 --> 00:05:45.788
It occurred to me, until I
meet this amazing doctor.

00:05:45.788 --> 00:05:49.538
His name is Paul Farmer, and I think
he bridged some of that gap for me.

00:05:52.871 --> 00:05:56.079
Michael Murphy continues his
story on the TED stage.

00:05:56.288 --> 00:05:58.663
Just as I was about to
start my final exams,

00:05:58.663 --> 00:06:02.204
I decided to take a break from
an all nighter and go to